n (AC-1 to AC-10) to what satisfies it. No questions need a human answer.\n\nFiles are in `.dark-factory/runs/909734b4-8658-45f3-b826-d15b34fb4c10/artifacts/ARCHITECTURE/`:\n- `design.md`\n- `constraints.json`","ttft_ms":1910,"type":"result","duration_ms":40824,"uuid":"7dd5f008-5a58-4ffd-b608-073d59d3a946","ttft_stream_ms":1073,"time_to_request_ms":194,"first_content_frame_ms":1074,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
